{"2259240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DESPA", "steam_appid": 2259240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Playtest | DEC 5 | 6 PM UTC</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/708ca7090b4947b6ffef1fd382c92bca.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a katana to a gunfight and raise hell on your next coffee break.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to DESPA</strong> — a brutal, neon-lit arena shooter built for after-work warriors who’ve got more stress than free time. No bullshit. No downtime. Just steel, speed, and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/2cf55ab5412fe64e3050ba90125faefd.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/76be7903a3a3193e8636708a27ef43f9.poster.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/76be7903a3a3193e8636708a27ef43f9.webm?t=1775725069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant matchmaking, 7-minute rounds. Blink and you're dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair aim-assist: controller or mouse, skill wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >140-tick servers. Lag? Not here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/029020931bbed30446f6aa1b6612e838.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/76a46fd9c15106575646fd6806862a84.poster.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/76a46fd9c15106575646fd6806862a84.webm?t=1775725069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, wall-run, grapple. If you’re not moving, you’re losing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the arena. It doesn’t care who you are, just how you kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/abfedb4bbf27f8c6c01f55ae15273e8f.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/3504467219644c3ff0bd1c2ad397d13b.poster.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/3504467219644c3ff0bd1c2ad397d13b.webm?t=1775725069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart spawns put you behind the bastard who killed you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No rules. No humanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/ad15c2ccc3c88c9ad983a68123b490e5.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=80 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/76be7903a3a3193e8636708a27ef43f9.poster.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/76be7903a3a3193e8636708a27ef43f9.webm?t=1775725069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kill counts: earn medals that unlock badass skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-minute daily quests. Done by your second espresso.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win. Ever. Just gear that looks lethal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/37fa211d7b933cc000b8ee4ce454d5d7.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/5b4a96da7917897cef27337bd3648c1d.poster.avif?t=1775725069\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/5b4a96da7917897cef27337bd3648c1d.webm?t=1775725069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school heart. 2026 muscle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot is earned. Every frag is personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speed. Designed for chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=